<view class="page settings-page">
  <view class="enter-up">
    <view class="eyebrow">LOCAL LAB</view>
    <view class="title">体验设置</view>
    <view class="subtitle">切换模拟状态，检查正常解读和安全降级；这里不会调用真实模型。</view>
  </view>

  <view class="settings-section enter-up delay-1">
    <view class="section-kicker">SIMULATION MODE</view>
    <view class="section-title">解读响应</view>
    <view class="mode-list">
      <view wx:for="{{modes}}" wx:key="value" class="mode {{selectedMode === item.value ? 'selected' : ''}}" data-value="{{item.value}}" bindtap="selectMode">
        <view class="mode-index">0{{index + 1}}</view>
        <view class="mode-copy">
          <view class="mode-name">{{item.label}}</view>
          <view class="mode-desc">{{item.description}}</view>
        </view>
        <view class="indicator"><view></view></view>
      </view>
    </view>
  </view>

  <view class="data-panel enter-up delay-2">
    <view class="panel-icon">◇</view>
    <view class="section-kicker">PRIVATE BY DEFAULT</view>
    <view class="section-title">本地数据边界</view>
    <view class="muted">本阶段不使用微信云身份、账号、CloudBase 或真实 AI。历史与图鉴仅保存在当前设备的小程序存储沙箱。</view>
    <view class="data-row">
      <view><view class="data-name">解读历史</view><view class="data-note">每日牌与主动保存内容</view></view>
      <button class="danger-link" bindtap="clearHistory">全部清空</button>
    </view>
    <view class="data-row">
      <view><view class="data-name">卡牌图鉴</view><view class="data-note">当前进度 {{collectionProgress}}</view></view>
      <button class="danger-link" bindtap="clearCollection">重置图鉴</button>
    </view>
  </view>

  <view class="about-panel enter-up delay-3">
    <image class="about-logo" src="/assets/branding/arcana-mirror-logo.jpg" mode="aspectFill" />
    <view class="about-copy">
      <view class="section-title">阿卡纳心镜</view>
      <view class="muted">娱乐性自我探索，不预测确定未来，也不替代心理、医疗、法律或金融专业意见。</view>
      <view class="version">LOCAL PREVIEW · 0.3.0</view>
    </view>
  </view>
</view>
